WEBVTT

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.700
Defeat Tamaki!

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:08.960
Yeah!

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:10.910
There's no way I'm going to lose!

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:53.590
Since it's a new semester,

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:55.800
I want everyone to choose a new class representative for the second semester.

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:57.520
Class representative?

00:01:57.520 --> 00:01:58.490
Do we have to?

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:00.850
Can't it be the same one as last semester?

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:02.940
Quiet.

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:04.770
Is there anyone willing to run?

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:08.730
Yes, there is. I want to continue being the class representative for the second semester.

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:10.060
Tamaki.

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:11.690
There she goes, runnin' her mouth.

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:14.260
Only Tamaki, eh? Well then...

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:21.060
Miyamoto Masaharu.

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:23.080
You want to run too?

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.460
What do you want to do?

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:31.630
I want to run.

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:34.540
Okay.

00:02:34.540 --> 00:02:37.260
We will have the election next week during homeroom.

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:38.340
Okay?

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:45.970
Tamaki is getting fired up.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:54.580
Defeat Tamaki! The Class Representative Election.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:01.490
I didn't think Masaharu-kun would run.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:05.200
He doesn't stand out very much.

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:08.850
But Masaharu-kun is a pretty nice fella.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:14.350
When I transferred here, he helped me out a lot.

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:20.840
He gave me a seatin' chart so that I could remember everyone's names better.

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:25.760
When I couldn't find our classroom, he showed me where it was.

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:30.390
When the classwork went faster than my old school, he gave me his notes.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:36.700
I think one of the reasons I got used to this school so fast was 'cause of him.

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:39.270
I see.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:41.110
Welcome!

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:45.280
Masaharu-kun!

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:47.290
Um...

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:49.640
Are you looking for some magic goods that will help you win the election?

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:51.710
Yeah, I guess.

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.210
Hey, can I ask you somethin'?

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:55.420
What is it?

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:59.680
Why'd ya suddenly wanna run for class representative?

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:02.380
Everyone's all bothered by it now.

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:06.880
I was always second in anything I would do.

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:10.590
I've never been first in studying or in sports.

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:14.060
I've been a representative before, but I was always the second in command.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:17.510
However, I want to change myself.

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:22.030
And that's why. Is it strange?

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.140
Nope.

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:25.170
I can understand how you feel.

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:26.500
Yeah.

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:29.480
I'm actually the world's unluckiest pretty girl.

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:31.850
I want to change myself too.

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:33.790
I think that's something different.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:39.250
Either way, I think Masaharu-kun would be a wonderful class representative.

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:40.960
R-Really?

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:44.570
Don't worry, we'll definitely vote for ya.

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:45.260
Yep!

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:46.460
Thank you.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.260
Tamaki Reika.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:53.700
Please support Tamaki Reika.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:55.940
What is she doing?

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:58.210
With the goal of being an open and happy class representative,

00:04:58.210 --> 00:04:59.420
Tamaki Reika.

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:00.810
Tamaki can do it.

00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:03.750
Everyone, put your vote for Tamaki Reika.

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:06.360
This is called fishing for votes.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.660
Fish is good with rice.

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:11.320
Your gags are so funny.

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:16.100
I've always admired your sense of humor, Sagawa-kun.

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:18.080
Thanks for the compliment.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.170
Now I have to vote for you.

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:21.750
Thank you.

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.080
Do your best.

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.670
We will support you.

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:26.180
Thank you so much!

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:32.810
Let's do our best, Masaharu-kun.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:37.480
Well, we shall know who the class wants once the election comes.

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:42.190
This ain't good fer Masaharu-kun.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:44.410
He's not a very forward guy.

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:51.620
Masaharu-kun?

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:52.840
What are you doing?

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.150
The nail is coming out of this chair.

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:58.070
But that's not your seat.

00:05:58.070 --> 00:05:58.790
I know.

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:01.570
From time to time, I check the things in the classroom,

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:03.550
so that no one gets hurt.

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.220
I didn't know that.

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:09.180
Now that you mention it, when the shelf in the back broke, someone fixed it.

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:10.550
Was that you?

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:12.220
Yes.

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:19.210
Alright. The three of us will be your campaign team, okay?

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:21.190
That's a good idea!

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:25.860
Let's get as many votes as we can for the election next week.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:27.000
Yeah!

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:30.040
What should we make?

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:33.830
First we have to let everyone know about Masaharu-kun's good points.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.290
Who cares about that!? What about work!?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:40.750
Then let's make a banner that tells everyone what Masaharu-kun has done.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.240
Hey! Are you listening to me!?

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:48.030
And we should tell everyone to think before votin'!

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:49.770
Leave that to me.

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:52.650
How about putting an ad in the newspaper?

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:53.880
That's great, that's great.

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.950
Then that's Hadzuki-chan's job.

00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:57.930
Let's do our best.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:58.720
Okay!

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:03.430
As I was saying, you girls wasted your magic spheres last time, so do some work!

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:04.270
Jeez.

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:17.700
~ Long time no see. ~

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:18.570
Dela.
~ Long time no see. ~

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:18.580
Dela.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:26.400
~ I think you girls want some magic spheres, right? ~

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:31.800
See? Our bill went up because of your magic spheres.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.440
Oh yeah.

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:37.260
Majo Ruka has been preparing to run for the Queen Election.

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:40.830
She has passed out a lot of flyers, hoping to win over the hearts of the people.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:42.830
What?

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:46.770
Majo Rika, you're also a candidate for the next Queen.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:50.180
I think you can get some advice from Doremi and the others.

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:54.240
I should have become Queen much sooner.

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:55.530
That's true.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.610
What did you say!?

00:07:58.420 --> 00:07:59.330
Dodo.

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:01.160
What is... this?

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:04.170
Is this your symbol?

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:06.160
No, no, this won't do.

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:10.250
Rere, Mimi, Hadzuki-chan, can you make something cooler?

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:20.020
Please support Masaharu-kun this election!

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.890
Good morning.

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:25.130
Yer really into it!

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:29.230
We stayed up making flyers, so I thought you'd definitely be late.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:31.420
Well, I'm just a little bit tired.

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:35.880
A kind and helpful class representative. Miyamoto Masaharu.

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:38.390
That's a pretty good catchphrase!

00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:41.830
Masaharu-kun.

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:44.290
Look, we made these.

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:48.550
Masaharu-kun has been elected vice class representative twice.

00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:50.180
He was second in the marathon.

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:52.260
He was second in the school art contest.

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.970
That's really good, getting second place.

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:57.680
Yeah.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:01.640
Doremi-chan, how can ya put up such a depressing flyer?

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:04.540
I think second place is really great.

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:07.610
I have never been in second place before.

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:08.860
Oh yeah!

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:11.150
I have some results from my investigation.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:16.030
From my telephone survey, the two candidates are neck-in-neck with each other.

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:17.060
Oh?

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.120
Neck-in-neck?

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:22.620
I mean that the election ain't a done deal.

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:25.290
This sounds like an interesting challenge.

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:26.740
I can't wait.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.900
Tamaki looks strong on the outside,

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:34.220
but she's all worried after hearing about that surprising survey.

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:36.680
Doremi-chan, you didn't have to say surprising.

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:38.940
I'm sorry.

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:40.140
That's fine.

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:43.850
In any case, Masaharu-kun, there ain't time for ya to be depressed.

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:44.870
Yeah...

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:46.370
Oh yeah.

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:48.240
What about our symbol?

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:49.090
Yeah.

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:52.260
I want Masaharu-kun to pick his favorite one.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:54.420
Yeah...

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:56.570
I like this one the best.

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:59.590
Dodo made that one.

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:02.520
B-But if Masaharu-kun likes that one...

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:03.240
Yeah.

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:06.120
Let's put that symbol in and make a new flyer.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:09.580
Ah, I want to do some campaigning myself,

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:11.960
so I brought this.

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:14.920
I think that's just a li'l outta place...

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:20.720
You're a hundred years too early to be challenging me.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.090
Just you wait.

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:26.270
To everyone having recess,

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:28.630
can you hear me out?

00:10:28.630 --> 00:10:29.440
About what?

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:33.730
If I, Tamaki Reika, am elected,

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:37.000
I will propose three new rules.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:41.450
One, I will make cleaning days every three days instead of every day.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:44.910
And we will use rock, paper, scissors to decide who's doing the cleaning.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:47.040
Oh, sounds interesting!

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:52.540
Two, I will make copies of my beautiful, perfect homework for everyone.

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:53.860
Really?

00:10:53.860 --> 00:11:02.550
Three, I will give beauty massages to the female students every single day.

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:09.860
And finally, I, Tamaki Reika, shall create my campaign team!

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:12.380
Those who join will receive...

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:17.820
my homemade cookies as a present for supporting me!

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:19.740
I'll join, I'll join!

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:20.940
Me too, me too!

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:21.450
Me too!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:24.650
That new rule ain't fair for someone like me who sucks at rock, paper, scissors.

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:27.350
And I always finish my homework every day.

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:29.740
But those cookies look delicious.

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:31.030
Doremi-chan!

00:11:31.030 --> 00:11:31.670
Sorry.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:33.250
Oh my.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:36.580
I don't mind if you three want to join too.

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:41.070
After all, my campaign team is only fit for us who are gorgeous.

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:44.750
That's too underhanded, no matter how much you want to be class representative.

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:45.890
Yer goin' overboard.

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:46.640
Yeah!

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:52.710
Everyone, calm down.

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:55.750
We're all classmates, so we should get along.

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:56.240
Hmph!

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:58.800
Look at that attitude!

00:11:58.800 --> 00:11:59.620
Oh yeah.

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:02.110
Masaharu-kun, have you thought of any new rules?

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:06.160
Any ideas that can beat Tamaki?

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:08.830
I have thought about it, but...

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:09.650
Okay!

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:15.460
Miyamoto Masaharu-kun is going to make a speech! Please listen!

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:19.900
One, cleaning will be done three times a day.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:24.180
It will be done in the morning, afternoon, and after school so we can have a clean classroom.

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:29.600
Two, I wish for everyone in class to look after the field once a week.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:34.950
Three, in order to have good relations with the people in our neighborhood,

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:38.110
I want to hold a monthly neighborhood clean-up event.

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:39.000
And also...

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:40.430
Masaharu-kun!

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:41.570
We get it, that's enough!

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:43.000
This ain't good.

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:44.500
This didn't go as planned.

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:11.590
My last survey indicated that everyone wants Tamaki.

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:13.180
The election is tomorrow.

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:16.330
Tamaki-san will win at this rate.

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:20.430
Welcome.

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:23.690
Masaharu-kun.

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.850
I brought a little something.

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:29.070
You made these yourself, Masaharu-kun?

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:31.180
I can't guarantee how well they'll taste, though.

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:32.160
Thank you.

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:33.430
Here we go!

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:36.290
These are good.

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:39.500
Tamaki-san really does have the upper hand, huh?

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:42.460
Seems so.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:45.860
I'm sorry to have you all work so hard for me.

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:48.150
Masaharu-kun, you don't have to apologize.

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:49.180
Yeah!

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.290
But...

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:56.440
If ya can have everyone see yer good points, I'm sure everyone'll vote for ya!

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:59.300
That way, everyone won't be fooled by Tamaki's flowery words.

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:00.360
Is that so?

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:01.510
Yeah!

00:14:01.510 --> 00:14:02.910
Defeat Tamaki!

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:06.860
We won't have you lose to someone like her!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:08.630
D-Doremi-chan.

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:09.620
She's all fired up.

00:14:10.390 --> 00:14:16.310
The honest and nice Masaharu is way better than someone like Tamaki who buys her votes.

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:19.200
Please cast your vote for Masaharu.

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:21.110
Hey, Masaharu-kun, you too.

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:23.240
Oh. Thank you.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.190
Kotake.

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:27.980
Please vote for Masaharu-kun.

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:31.970
But Tamaki's new rules are good for the class.

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:36.180
If you think about it, those new rules are trash.

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:38.340
What are you getting mad about?

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:42.650
Even without you trying to persuade me, I'd still vote for Masaharu.

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:44.360
Do your best.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:45.610
Ah, yeah.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:47.570
I'm also voting for Masaharu.

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:49.040
Yada-kun.

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:50.240
Me too.

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:51.450
Thank you.

00:14:57.490 --> 00:15:00.580
A class representative needs skill and charisma.

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:03.880
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:06.940
What can a normal candidate like you do?

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:08.780
Yeah, yeah!

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:10.910
Go, go, Tamaki!

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:13.350
Fight, fight, Reika!

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:14.970
What strong conviction.

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:18.150
I had these custom made for me.

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.150
Tamaki Reika.

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:25.110
Please give your vote to Tamaki Reika.

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:27.590
What? How can they pass those out?

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:30.400
Okay, we ain't gonna lose to 'em!

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:32.410
Girls' Bathroom

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:50.090
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:55.990
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:15:55.990 --> 00:15:59.000
Let Masaharu's election goods appear!

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:03.690
Miyamoto Masaharu.

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:06.060
Please vote for Miyamoto Masaharu!

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:07.740
How weak!

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:09.080
No taste at all!

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:11.360
We have this!

00:16:12.600 --> 00:16:15.900
Tamaki Reika works hard for everyone's sake.

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:18.670
Please, everyone, vote for me!

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:20.860
S-So showy.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:22.830
If that's the case...

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:31.590
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:35.090
Elegant and cool clothes, come out!

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:40.360
The prince on a white horse that will work hard for everyone!

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:43.600
Please vote for Miyamoto Masaharu!

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:45.660
What's this? A prince on a white horse?

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:46.860
How embarrassing.

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:49.190
And aren't you guys all style and no substance?

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:51.900
I think the word you're looking for is elegance.

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:53.100
Where exactly?

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:56.550
Everyone, please go to the video room.

00:16:56.550 --> 00:16:59.330
We have prepared a fabulous video.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.790
A video?

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.460
All About Tamaki Reika

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:10.460
I, Tamaki Reika, had a beautiful and elegant childhood.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:17.470
I promise that your school lives will be as gorgeous and regal as mine.

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:18.910
What <i>is</i>  this?

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:20.550
I'm getting dizzy.

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:21.640
We have one too!

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:29.520
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:33.270
Masaharu-kun's promotion video, come out!

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:37.700
All About Miyamoto Masaharu

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.380
He really is the number two man.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:51.510
T-That's not true.

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:55.260
Yeah, you should say that he is humble!

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:58.330
Don't be fooled, everyone.

00:17:58.330 --> 00:18:01.890
I promise that Masaharu-kun is the better person to be class representative.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:05.600
We promise too that the most suitable person is Tamaki.

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:10.060
We should elect someone who actually thinks about us.

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:13.780
So you all want to clean three times a day?

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.250
Y-Yes, we do!

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:18.420
Stop fighting already.

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:24.540
The class is split into two... I can't stand it.

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:26.250
Masaharu-kun.

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.110
I...

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:29.710
I think I'll give up.

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:34.120
It doesn't matter who becomes class representative.

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:37.880
The most important thing is that everyone gets along.

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:42.390
Everyone would be happy that way, right?

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:44.770
It's better than having the class split in two.

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:51.600
Tamaki-san, I'll be the vice class representative.

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:54.860
Let's do our best together for the second semester.

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.340
Is that okay?

00:18:57.340 --> 00:19:01.280
Didn't you want to change yourself and not be second anymore?

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:04.780
I was too stupid, making you all fight over this.

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:10.750
Running for class representative just to be number one was a bad decision on my part.

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.760
So I'm fine now.

00:19:12.760 --> 00:19:15.210
Thank you for supporting me up until now.

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:23.820
We supported you mainly because we wanted to defeat Tamaki.

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:27.690
Maybe we created some bad memories for ya.

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:28.390
Yeah.

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:29.680
That's fine.

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:34.110
Anyway, you guys should get along with Tamaki-san, for the sake of the class.

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:37.770
How can a candidate back out?

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:41.990
We need to have a proper contest, right?

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:43.450
B-But...

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:45.710
I'd rather you do that.

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:48.410
If that's what Tamaki-san wants...

00:19:49.780 --> 00:19:52.640
My pride won't allow a win without a fight.

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:55.880
Either way, I'll win no matter what.

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:57.830
What are you doing?

00:19:57.830 --> 00:19:59.340
Get back to your seats.

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:08.330
Now then, we shall start the class representative election.

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:10.310
We will pass out the papers for you to vote on.

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:13.760
Please write down the person you think is most suitable.

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:22.690
Now then, we shall announce the results.

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:24.570
The people in charge today are...

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:26.540
Iida and Amano. Please come up.

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:28.990
Tamaki Reika-san.

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.390
Tamaki Reika
Miyamoto Masaharu

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:31.540
Tamaki Reika-san.

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:34.580
Miyamoto Masaharu-kun.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:37.380
Tamaki Reika
Miyamoto Masaharu

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:59.110
Miyamoto Masaharu-kun.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:05.070
Well then, our class representative for the second semester is Miyamoto Masaharu.

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:06.450
Alright!

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.260
Congratulations, Masaharu-kun.

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:09.530
Thank goodness.

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:17.430
Why!?

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:20.920
I should have won without a fight!

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:23.660
Masaharu, please make a statement.

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:25.040
Yes, ma'am.

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:30.100
Um, I will work hard to make a pleasant atmosphere for everyone.

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:31.720
Thank you very much.

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:37.690
Everyone understood Masaharu-kun's good points.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:38.460
Yup!

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:44.070
As I promised, we'll clean three times a day and help clear the weeds around school.

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:45.030
And...

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:48.450
We will hold a neighborhood cleaning event!

00:21:49.260 --> 00:21:51.820
Starting next week, Monday morning,

00:21:51.820 --> 00:21:54.200
everyone is to gather here at 8 o'clock to weed some grass.

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:05.370
The Misora Elementary School athletic meet!

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:07.150
Everyone thinks red is going to win.

00:22:07.150 --> 00:22:09.350
That's because Itoko-chan's five siblings are all on the red team.

00:22:09.350 --> 00:22:12.830
From first to sixth grade, the Hamadas are the ultimate relay family.

00:22:12.830 --> 00:22:15.580
I, Doremi-sama, am a monster at the relay too, and I'm also on the red team.

00:22:15.580 --> 00:22:16.980
No, yer terrible.

00:22:16.980 --> 00:22:18.660
I even trained to catch the baton too.

00:22:18.660 --> 00:22:21.210
You haven't trained anywhere near enough!

00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:23.700
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:23.700 --> 00:22:25.650
Great Panic at the Athletic Meet!

00:22:25.650 --> 00:22:28.420
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
